{title: Fire Asho Na}
{artist: Imran}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
O [Am]smiritir majhe [F]dubh satare,        [Am]Buker vetor [G]uthche kepe
[F]Jolorashite [Dm]chokher sagor,        [C]Theme theme [G]uthche fepe
Bolo [Am]kivabe robo [Dm]evabe,        Amay [Em]gochabe ke [F]du haathe
Fire [Am]asho na ar to [Dm]pari naa,        Bachi [Em]cholo na
[F]abar [C]eksathe.. [Am] ... [F] ..        [Am]Koto ta kothin [F]bacha tumihin
[Am]Andhar bilin [G]shopnera [Am]hay,        [Am]Theme jibon [F]ache ekhon
[Am]Bachar emon [G]mane [Am]kothay,        Keno je [G]hay [Am]purnotake
Melale [Dm]neel [Am]shunnotate,        Bolo [Am]kivabe robo [Dm]evabe
Amay [Em]gochabe ke [F]du haathe,        Fire [Am]asho na ar to [Dm]pari naa
Bachi [Em]cholo na,        [F]abar [C]eksathe.. [Am] ... [F] ..
[Am]Harano khoto [F]obiroto,        [Am]Monete koto [G]betha diye [Am]jaay
[Am]Dine raate [F]artonaader,        [Am]Prem je kade [G]ki kore [Am]bojhai
Keno je [G]hay [Am]purnotake,        Melale [Dm]neel [Am]shunnotate
Bolo [Am]kivabe robo [Dm]evabe,        Amay [Em]gochabe ke [F]du haathe
Fire [Am]asho na ar to [Dm]pari naa,        Bachi [Em]cholo na [F]abar eksathe
